  "operative_text": "Section 1 (N.D.C.C. 62.1-02-05(1)): An individual may not possess a firearm or dangerous weapon at: a. A school or school-sponsored event on school property; b. A church or other place of worship;\nSection 1 (N.D.C.C. 62.1-02-05(6)): An individual who knowingly violates this section is guilty of an infraction.\nSection 2: Section 62.1-02-04 of the North Dakota Century Code is repealed."
